WEBVTT

00:01:27.371 --> 00:01:30.121
Randomized clinical trials 
are incredible tools,

00:01:30.163 --> 00:01:32.496
and, in fact, the US Food 
and Drug Administration

00:01:32.538 --> 00:01:34.996
often requires at least
two to be conducted

00:01:35.038 --> 00:01:37.663
before a new drug can be marketed.

00:01:37.704 --> 00:01:40.954
But the problem is that an RCT 
is not possible in many cases,

00:01:40.996 --> 00:01:44.496
either because it’s not practical
or it would require too many volunteers.

00:01:44.538 --> 00:01:47.329
In such cases, scientists 
use an epidemiological study,

00:01:47.371 --> 00:01:50.579
which simply observes people 
going about their usual behavior,

00:01:50.621 --> 00:01:53.621
rather than randomly assigning 
active participants

00:01:53.663 --> 00:01:55.746
to control invariable groups.

00:01:55.871 --> 00:01:57.246
Let's say we wanted to study

00:01:57.288 --> 00:02:00.038
whether an herbal ingredient 
on the market causes nausea.